#. Manuellt granskad säker regression 2026-10-26.
#: app/views/mailer/user_device_new_location/en.html.erb
msgid ""
"#{config.product_name} login from a new country\n"
"\n"
"<div>Hi #{user.firstname},</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>It looks like you used your account with a <b>known device but from a new country</b> on \"#{user_device.created_at}\":</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>\n"
"Your device: #{user_device.name}<br>\n"
"Your location (relative): #{user_device.location}<br>\n"
"Your IP: #{user_device.ip}<br>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>The country has been added to your list of known devices, which you can view here:</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div><a href=\"#{config.http_type}://#{config.fqdn}/#profile/devices\">#{config.http_type}://#{config.fqdn}/#profile/devices</a></div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>If this wasn't you, please remove the device, change your account password, and contact your administrator. Somebody might have gained unauthorized access to your account.</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>Your #{config.product_name} Team</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"#{config.product_name}-inloggning från ett nytt land\n"
"\n"
"<div>Hej #{user.firstname},</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>Det verkar som att du använde ditt konto med en <b>känd enhet från ett nytt land</b> den #{user_device.created_at}:</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>\n"
"Din enhet: #{user_device.name}<br>\n"
"Din plats (relativ): #{user_device.location}<br>\n"
"Din IP-adress: #{user_device.ip}<br>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>Landet har lagts till i din lista över kända enheter, som du kan se här:</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div><a href=\"#{config.http_type}://#{config.fqdn}/#profile/devices\">#{config.http_type}://#{config.fqdn}/#profile/devices</a></div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>Om det inte var du, ta bort enheten, ändra kontolösenordet och kontakta administratören. Någon kan ha fått obehörig åtkomst till ditt konto.</div>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<div>Ditt #{config.product_name}-team</div>\n"

